PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_Intro::
    .string "{RIVAL}: {PLAYER}.\p"
    .string "I thought it would be you.\p"
    .string "A rival keeps me sharp. That is\n"
    .string "what you are for.\p"
    .string "I went through the whole INDEX for\n"
    .string "the strongest DAEMONS there are.\p"
    .string "I built teams that beat every type\n"
    .string "there is.\p"
    .string "And now…\p"
    .string "I am the DAEMON LEAGUE champion.\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}. Do you know what that\n"
    .string "means?\p"
    .string "I will tell you.\p"
    .string "It means I did it right.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "{RIVAL}: {PLAYER}. You came back.\p"
    .string "Good. A rival keeps me sharp.\p"
    .string "I went through the INDEX again, for\n"
    .string "the strongest DAEMONS there are.\p"
    .string "I built teams that beat every type\n"
    .string "there is.\p"
    .string "And now…\p"
    .string "I am the DAEMON LEAGUE champion\n"
    .string "again.\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}. Do you know what that\n"
    .string "means?\p"
    .string "I will tell you.\p"
    .string "It means I did it right. Twice.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_Defeat::
    .string "No.\p"
    .string "I did it right. Every step of it.\p"
    .string "It is over already? That is not\n"
    .string "fair.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_Victory::
    .string "はーはッ！\n"
    .string "かった！　かった！　かった！\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}に　まける　ような\n"
    .string "おれさま　では　なーい！\p"
    .string "ま！　ポケモンの\n"
    .string "てんさい　{RIVAL}さま　あいてに\l"
    .string "ここまで　よく　がんばった！\p"
    .string "ほめて　つかわす！\n"
    .string "はーッ！　はーはッはッ！$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "Why did I lose?\p"
    .string "I did not make one mistake raising\n"
    .string "them. Not one.\p"
    .string "…You are the DAEMON LEAGUE\n"
    .string "champion.\p"
    .string "I do not like saying it.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakPlayer::
    .string "CRYSTAL: {PLAYER}!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakCongratulations::
    .string "CRYSTAL: So. You won.\p"
    .string "You are the DAEMON LEAGUE champion\n"
    .string "now.\p"
    .string "You left BLANCHE with {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
    .string "I remember the day.\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}. You are not the one who\n"
    .string "walked out of my lab.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakImDisappointedRival::
    .string "CRYSTAL: {RIVAL}.\p"
    .string "I came when I heard you had beaten\n"
    .string "the REVIEW BOARD.\p"
    .string "By the time I got here, you had\n"
    .string "already lost.\p"
    .string "You did everything correctly. I\n"
    .string "know. I have watched you do it.\p"
    .string "{RIVAL}. You will want to know why.\p"
    .string "Nobody is going to be able to tell\n"
    .string "you. Not today.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakPlayerComeWithMe::
    .string "CRYSTAL: {PLAYER}.\p"
    .string "Come with me. There is a room\n"
    .string "through there.\p"
    .string "It will want your name, and your\n"
    .string "DAEMONS' names, and their levels.\p"
    .string "That is all it will want.$"

